# \[[mailto:yjbian@mail.ustc.edu.cn Email]\], \[[https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=SmvfHHgAAAAJ&hl=en&oi=ao Google Scholar]\], \[[https://github.com/eustomaqua GitHub]\], \[[https://www.linkedin.com/in/yijunbian/ LinkedIn]\], \[[https://dblp.org/pid/222/1897.html dblp]\], \[[https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5926-7100 ORCID]\]


I am currently a Marie Skłodowska-Curie postdoctoral fellow advised by Prof. [https://sites.google.com/site/yevgenyseldin Yevgeny Seldin] at the Department of Computer Science, University of Copenhagen (UCPH), funded by the European Union (the [https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportunities/portal/screen/how-to-participate/org-details/999999999/project/101106768/program/43108390/details FairML] project, and [https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/101106768 CORDIS]). I obtained my Ph.D. degree from the Department of Computer Science and Technology, University of Science and Technology of China (USTC), and was very fortunate to be supervised by Prof. [http://staff.ustc.edu.cn/~hchen/ Huanhuan Chen]. 
My research interests span the areas of machine learning, ensemble methods, and fairness in machine learning. 


